0 17592186045417 true] [17592186417774 1068 #edb/ref 17592186417771 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417774 1069 "q-81133" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417774 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417774 1071 "If $Y={20,22,24,…,180},$ which collection of subsets of $Y$ is a partition of $Y?$" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417774 1072 #uuid "2504f101-1688-516e-9a69-2239c6d88288" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417774 1074 "A partition of a set $Y$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $Y$ where every element of $Y$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{20,22,24,…,60},{62,64,66,…,120},{122,124,126,…,180}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${{20,22,24,…,70},{140,142,144,…,180}}$ is not a partition because some elements of $Y,$ such as $72,74,…,138,$ do not appear in any subsets.\n\n- ${{20,22,24,…,80},{66,68,70,…,180}}$ is not a partition because the elements $66,68,…,80$ appear in both subsets.\n\n- ${{2,4,6,…,180}}$ is not a partition because it contains many elements, such as $2,4,…,20,$ that do not appear in $Y.$\n\n- ${{20,22,24,26},{27,28,29,…,180}}$ is not a partition because it contains many elements, such as $27$ and $29,$ that do not appear in $Y.$" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417775 1068 #edb/ref 17592186417770 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417775 1069 "q-105882" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417775 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417775 1071 "If $T={0,2,4,6,8,10}$, which collection of subsets of $T$ is a partition of $T?$" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417775 1072 #uuid "84e33efb-d3f8-5005-acd9-dce160c0ccce" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417775 1074 "A partition of a set $T$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $T$ where every element of $T$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{0,10},{2,4,6,8}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${∅,{0,2,4,6,8},{10}}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- ${{0,2,4,6,8,10,12}}$ is not a partition because the element $12$ does not appear in $T.$\n\n- ${{0,10},{2},{4,8}}$ is not a partition because the element $6\\in T$ does not appear in any subset.\n\n- ${{0,10},{2,4,6,8,10}}$ is not a partition because the element $10$ appears in two subsets." 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417776 1068 #edb/ref 17592186417773 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417776 1069 "q-1277" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417776 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417776 1071 "If $B={-2,-1,0,1,2}$, which collection of subsets of $B$ is a partition of $B?$" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417776 1072 #uuid "9baec781-6727-5070-ba93-d0e0e2886415" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417776 1074 "A partition of a set $B$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $B$ where every element of $B$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{-2,0},{-1,1},{2}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${{-2,-1},{-1,1},{0}}$ is not a partition because the element $-1$ appears in two subsets.\n\n- ${{-2,-1},{-1,0},{1,2}}$ is not a partition because the element $-1$ appears in two subsets.\n\n- ${{-2,-1,0},{-2,2},{-2,1},{-1,0}}$ is not a partition because the elements $-2,$ $-1$ and $0$ appear in multiple subsets.\n\n- ${∅,{-2,-1},{0,1,2}}$  is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty." 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417777 1068 #edb/ref 17592186417769 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417777 1069 "q-81136" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417777 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417777 1071 "If $X={f,g,h,i,j,k,l},$ which collection of subsets of $X$ is a partition of $X?$" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417777 1072 #uuid "ec641cad-eaa5-5110-9da2-21a5ecc5614d" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417777 1074 "A partition of a set $X$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $X$ where every element of $X$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{f,g,h},{i},{j,k,l}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${∅,{f,g,h,i},{j,k,l}}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- ${∅,{f},{g,h,i},{j,k,l}}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- ${{f,g,h},{h,i},{h,j,f,k,l}}$ is not a partition because the elements $f$ and $h$ appear in multiple subsets.\n\n- ${{f,g,h},{k,l}}$ is not a partition because the elements $i,j\\in X$ do not appear in any subset." 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417778 1068 #edb/ref 17592186417772 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417778 1069 "q-81134" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417778 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417778 1071 "If $E={40,44,48,…,140},$ which collection of subsets of $E$ is a partition of $E?$" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417778 1072 #uuid "fc7c0eb0-4d42-5938-af4f-77dd05abbdb7" 13194139534290 17592186045417 true] [17592186417778 1074 "A partition of a set $E$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $E$ where every element of $E$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{40,44,48,…,76},{80,84,88,…,92},{96,100,104,…,140}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${{40,44,48,…,72},{104,108,112,…,140}}$ is not a partition because many elements of $E$ (such as $96$) do not appear in any subsets.\n\n- ${{40,44,48,…,84},{56,60,64,…,140}}$ is not a partition because many elements (such as $56$) appear in both subsets.\n\n- ${{24,28,32,…,140}}$ is not a partition 